{"t":"INVH","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Invitation Homes Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Residential","employees":1725,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://www.invitationhomes.com","summary_en":"Invitation Homes Inc., is nation's premier single-family home leasing and management company, helping to expand housing through new development and strategic partnerships. Their purpose, Unlock the Power of Home, reflects their commitment to address America's housing needs by delivering high-quality living solutions and genuine care to those who choose the flexibility and value of leasing. Invitation Homes Inc. was incorporated in 6th June 2012 and is based in Dallas, United States.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Invitation Homes Inc.는 국내 최고의 단독 주택 임대 및 관리 회사로서 새로운 개발과 전략적 파트너십을 통해 주택 확장을 지원합니다. 그들의 목적인 Unlock the Power of Home은 임대의 유연성과 가치를 선택하는 사람들에게 고품질의 생활 솔루션과 진정한 관리를 제공함으로써 미국의 주택 수요를 해결하겠다는 그들의 약속을 반영합니다. Invitation Homes Inc.는 2012년 6월 6일에 설립되었으며 미국 달라스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":27.56,"mcap":16033421312.0,"pe":24.175438,"fpe":37.68425,"peg":null,"ps":5.6123495,"pb":1.817822,"ev_ebitda":16.547,"div":4.35,"beta":0.812,"hi52":30.893,"lo52":24.25},"fin":{"rev":2856811008.0,"rev_g":0.013,"eps_g":0.219,"gross":0.55024,"op":0.23721,"net":0.23887,"roe":0.07395,"fcf":1162354816.0,"cash":138790000.0,"debt":8806403072.0,"de":99.406,"eps":1.14,"feps":0.73134},"own":{"short":0.0432,"inst":1.03091,"insider":0.0034999999},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":32.69565,"median":33.0,"high":41.0,"low":28.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.12,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":8,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":7,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers